# RGJ-B3-004 — Java integration patch specification
#
# Apply to the Platform 1.0 Libretro.java overlay.
#
# Import:
#   import org.recompile.mobile.RG35XXAudioBootstrap;
#
# Startup: after ipcOut has been captured and before a MIDlet is loaded:
#   RG35XXAudioBootstrap.initialize();
#
# Game/core shutdown: after players are stopped/released and before process
# exit, invoke:
#   RG35XXAudioBootstrap.shutdown();
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - initialize() must never replace/redirect System.out.
# - failure is non-fatal while the legacy bridge exists.
# - initialization is once per Java process, not once per Player.
# - native RESET is sent during shutdown before the Java duplicate FD closes.
